{"meta":{"id":"tt45246384","type":"series","name":"Amor disfrazado","imdb_id":"tt45246384","description":"El heredero del Grupo Taekang, Yoon Yi-jun, es el sospechoso principal de un impactante asesinato. Para descubrir la verdad, Kang Jae-hee se hace pasar por hombre para ser el secretario de Yi-jun. Cuanto más cerca están de dar con la verdad, más se acercan Yi-jun y Jae-hee. ¿Podrán Jae-hee, que esconde su identidad, y Yi-jun, que esconde un secreto, confesar lo que sienten el uno por el otro?","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt45246384.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32g5MD6eHPAZ5NAgkNAURb4eupm.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tXbtAby9cNNuGOtRXKRVQvoFQBD.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama","Crimen","Action & Adventure"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-19T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"7.6","country":"South Korea","cast":["Yim Si-wan","설인아","김정현","연우","류승수","박준면","정한설","김도윤","정유민","김인권","김기방","남해준","안상우","최진호","홍은희","박아인","조승연","이영준","전영","소이한"],"director":["박단희"],"writer":["문수정","이아현","류도하"],"trailers":[{"source":"55ATD_SJ_Xw","type":"Trailer","name":"종합 예고","ytId":"55ATD_SJ_Xw","lang":"ko"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"55ATD_SJ_Xw","title":"종합 예고"}],"links":[{"name":"7.6","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt45246384"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Comedia"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Crimen","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Crimen"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Yim Si-wan","category":